1
00:00:04,546 --> 00:00:07,256
- It was a nice retirement party.
- I guess.

2
00:00:07,465 --> 00:00:11,175
(Howard:)Still, it's a shame Professor Rothman
was forced to step down.

3
00:00:11,386 --> 00:00:13,976
Well, what choice
did the university have? He snapped.

4
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:17,100
(Leonard:)It happens to theoretical physicists
all the time.

5
00:00:17,767 --> 00:00:20,477
(Howard:)I wonder how long Sheldon's got.

6
00:00:21,563 --> 00:00:23,483
(Sheldon:)These shrimp are all the same size.

7
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:25,730
There's no logical order
to eat them in.

8
00:00:28,111 --> 00:00:30,451
(Leonard:)Can't be very long.

9
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:33,537
(Raj:)Hey, look,
there's Rothman's empty office.

10
00:00:34,242 --> 00:00:35,412
(Raj:)- Sad.
- Yeah.

11
00:00:35,618 --> 00:00:37,708
- lndeed.
- So sad.

12
00:00:38,288 --> 00:00:40,248
(Sheldon:)Dibs.

13
00:00:43,209 --> 00:00:44,789
What's up, fellas?

14
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:46,793
(Sheldon:)What are you doing here, Kripke?

15
00:00:47,005 --> 00:00:49,505
Measuring my new office for drapes.

16
00:00:49,716 --> 00:00:52,676
(Sheldon:)This is not your office.
It hasn't been assigned yet.

17
00:00:52,886 --> 00:00:56,136
l called dibs at Christmas when
Rothman tried to have intercourse...

18
00:00:56,347 --> 00:00:58,387
(Kripke:)...with the Toys for Tots
collection box.

19
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:04,650
(Sheldon:)Offices are not assigned
because someone called dibs.

20
00:01:04,856 --> 00:01:07,196
- You just called dibs.
- Shut it.

21
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:11,650
(Sheldon:)Offices are assigned by seniority.
l arrived at the university first.

22
00:01:11,863 --> 00:01:15,863
l arrived at the office first.
I'm the proverbial early bird.

23
00:01:16,951 --> 00:01:18,531
(Sheldon:)- Gentlemen.
- Mr. Rothman.

24
00:01:18,745 --> 00:01:21,035
(Howard:)- Professor Rothman.
- Professor Rothman.

25
00:01:23,333 --> 00:01:24,873
(Rothman:)Good evening.

26
00:01:25,085 --> 00:01:27,045
(Rothman:)Good evening.
- See you.

27
00:01:29,547 --> 00:01:31,637
(Raj:)I'm glad
that men are wearing hats again.

28
00:01:33,009 --> 00:01:37,019
(Raj:)They're so distinguished.

